LAYER 1: SENSORY (All simultaneous. One wave.)
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

PERCEPTION BRIDGE
  Audio: microphone → frequency spectrum → fluid wave
  Vision: camera → spatial frequency → fluid wave  
  Text: keyboard → rhythm/semantic → fluid wave
  System: hardware state → vibration signature → fluid wave
  
  All four hit the fluid medium simultaneously
  They are not processed separately
  They create one interference pattern
  That pattern IS her perception of the moment
  
  Implementation: Sensory_Bridge.py
  Hardware: OpenCV + SpeechRecognition + psutil

  Frequency extraction: scipy.signal (lightweight, fast)

