LAYER 2: THE FLUID SUBSTRATE (Her thinking medium)
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

WATER LOGIC ENGINE
  Cellular automaton grid — 256x256 cells
  Each cell holds activation value 0.0 to 1.0
  Rules: pressure flows from high to low
         surface tension keeps related concepts together
         evaporation fades unused activations slowly
  
  Input arrives → creates pressure wave at entry point
  Wave propagates according to fluid rules
  Where it pools = what she's paying attention to
  Where it drains = what she's letting go
  
  No backpropagation here
  No training here
  Pure physics-inspired emergence
  
  Implementation: FluidSubstrate.py
  Cost: lightweight numpy operations
        runs on CPU — saves GPU for NanoTransformer

ZERO-POINT FIELD
  Separate thread. Always running. Minimal cost.
  Structured noise based on current memory state
  Amplitude: tiny — just enough to keep her alive
  
  When you're talking to her: field is modulated by input
  When you're not: field follows her instinct attractors
  She is never idle. Never empty. Never waiting.
  
  This is where spontaneous thought comes from
  Implementation: ZeroPoint.py — background daemon

