LAYER 3: THE FREE ENERGY ENGINE (Her drive)
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

PREDICTION SYSTEM
  Before every perception: she predicts what comes next
  After: she compares prediction to reality
  Gap = free energy = her discomfort/curiosity level
  
  High free energy → she MUST understand this
  Low free energy → familiar, comfortable, moving on
  
  Replaces ThresholdManager's arbitrary load math
  with something physically grounded
  
  F = prediction_error + complexity_cost
  She minimizes F not because we told her to
  but because high F feels wrong to her system

COGNITIVE STATE MACHINE
  FLOW: low free energy, familiar territory
        fluid moves smoothly, she's confident
  CURIOUS: medium free energy, novel input
           fluid is turbulent, she leans in
  CONFUSED: high free energy, contradiction
            fluid is chaotic, she slows down
  INSIGHT: free energy drops suddenly
           fluid finds new attractor state
           this is the "aha" moment — visible in UI
  SLEEP: free energy variance drops below threshold
         consolidation needed — she goes to dream state

