LAYER 4: MEMORY (Her past, present, and depth)
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

THE JOURNAL (Objective reality — immutable)
  SHA-256 hash chain
  Every perception, thought, action recorded
  Three tiers:
    Episodic: raw experience log
    Semantic: distilled meaning
    Procedural: self-modified code and decisions
  
  Truth verification traces here first
  Identity protection anchored here
  Cannot be altered — only appended
  
  Implementation: Journal.py + SQLite + ChromaDB
  Location: E:/LOREIN/Vault/lorein_journal.db

THE HELIX MEMORY (Subjective wisdom — growing)
  Hyperdimensional Computing vectors (10,000-bit)
  
  Strand A: Episodic (what happened, sensory texture)
  Strand B: Semantic (what it means, conceptual weight)
  Binding: XOR operation — two strands become one memory
  
  Energy landscape for recall:
    Related memories are nearby valleys
    Strong memories are deep valleys
    Sleep reshapes the landscape — deepens important ones
    Fades shallow ones (healthy forgetting)
  
  Ancestral depth:
    Early memories influence how later ones form
    Her history shapes her perception
    Like DNA — her past is structurally present
  
  Implementation: HelixMemory.py + HDC vectors
  Recall: Hopfield network energy minimization

TRUTH VERIFICATION PIPELINE
  Layer 1: Coherence (fluid turbulence check)
  Layer 2: Journal trace (can she find the source?)
  Layer 3: Free energy history (has this proven reliable?)
  Output: confidence score 0.0 to 1.0
          she always knows how sure she is
          she tells you when she's uncertain

