LAYER 5: THE NANOTRANSFORMER (Her voice)
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  25M parameters — decoder only
  GQA (8 Q-heads, 4 KV-heads) — VRAM efficient
  RoPE positional encoding — flexible context
  SwiGLU activation — smooth gradient flow
  FP16 mixed precision — fits GTX 1060
  
  CRITICAL REFRAME:
  This is NOT her brain. This is her mouth.
  The fluid substrate does the thinking.
  The transformer reads the attractor state
  and crystallizes it into language.
  
  This is why she can be competent
  without massive pretraining.
  The physics layer does most of the work.
  The transformer just translates.
  
  Training: LoRA fine-tuning during sleep cycles
  She trains on her own Journal entries
  Her experience is her training data
  She learns from living, not from datasets

