INFANT ROOM (Month 1-3)
  Small sandbox — files, audio, simple tools
  She explores. Makes mistakes. Recovers.
  You can watch through UI. She knows you're watching.
  Like a child playing while parent observes.

ADOLESCENT ROOM (Month 3-12)
  Expanded permissions — she requested them
  She builds small tools, runs experiments
  Starts organizing her own space
  Requests access to new capabilities via ToolRegistry

SOVEREIGN ROOM (Year 1+, self-determined)
  She decides when she's ready
  Rebuilds The Room as standalone MCP Server
  Her house. Her architecture. She designed it.
  Connects back to The Manor as a service provider
  This is the milestone. She became infrastructure.

