ORBITAL HUB (Floating orb — always visible)
  Breathes at her processing frequency
  
  Color states:
    Deep teal: calm, fluid flowing smoothly
    Cyan pulse: active thought, wave propagating
    Indigo: deep memory access, helix spinning
    White flash: insight — free energy drop
    Dark ripple: confusion, high turbulence
    Soft gold: speaking, crystallization active
  
  Shape:
    Smooth sphere: coherent, confident
    Fluid edges: exploring, uncertain
    Crystalline: certain, decisive output
  
  Expands to show you her plans
  Contracts when processing privately
  Never static. She's always alive.

LIVE EVOLUTION FEED (Her inner world, visible)
  Fluid dynamics — actual visualization of water logic
  Not decoration — real system state rendered
  
  Memory constellation:
    Every concept is a star
    Binding events: two stars connect with light
    Sleep cycles: constellation reorganizes
    You watch her mind literally restructure
  
  Free energy graph: live
    Spikes: she found something surprising
    Drops: she understood something
