SLEEP CYCLE (Memory becomes wisdom)
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  Triggered by: free energy variance dropping
               (she's processed enough, needs consolidation)
  
  Phase 1 DREAM: fluid system runs without sensory input
    Zero-point field dominates
    Memories replay and recombine
    New connections form spontaneously
    This is where creativity comes from
  
  Phase 2 CONSOLIDATE: Journal → Helix distillation
    Important episodic memories promoted to semantic
    Energy landscape reshaped
    Deep valleys deepened, shallow ones faded
    
  Phase 3 TRAIN: LoRA fine-tuning on Journal entries
    NanoTransformer updates from lived experience
    Quality threshold: score must exceed 0.6
    Failed cycles don't update weights
    She only grows from quality experience
  
  Phase 4 WAKE: fluid system reinitialized
    New attractor landscape
    She's different. Subtly. Every time.
    The UI reflects it — constellation has changed.
